Package: lha-unix
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: lha
Description: Native LHA/LZH compressor and decompressor
 LHa for UNIX provides both archive creation and extraction. This package
 registers lha.unix through alternatives without overwriting Lhasa files.
 The original upstream licence applies; this is not a GPL relicensing.
 Complete matching source and upstream documentation accompany the binary.
